Subject: [R-pkg-team] Bug#900618: tseries: unsatisfiable versioned
 dependency on quantmod (>= 0.4.9)
Message-ID: <CAM8zJQub3SZC=0POpRa-N7zee=AbDLJff063qUnoYYt_WLNqFQ@mail.gmail.com>

Source: tseries
Version: 0.10-44-1
Severity: serious
Tags: patch
X-Debbugs-CC: r-pkg-team at alioth-lists.debian.net

Hi Dirk

Due to some new magic in dh-r, r-cran-tseries gains a versioned
dependency on quantmod (>= 0.4.9), but we have 0.4-13-1 in the archive
and this makes r-cran-tseries not installable.

My guess is this was a typo upstream, and they meant 0.4-9 instead of 0.4.9.

Please consider including my patch, attached.

Regards
Graham
